	Hello,

I am pleased to announce the open-source release of matd, an AT commands ba=
ck-
end (DCE emulator) for Linux/MeeGo. It aims to support any relevant AT =

commands use case, e.g. USB CDC ACM gadget, Bluetooth Dial-Up Networking, =

automatic device testing, certification, etc.

matd is basically a glorified ITU-T V.250 parser using plugins to execute A=
T =

commands. It is now released under the Mozilla Public License 1.1 with the =

(L)GPL relicensing option. You can find it in the MeeGo cellular project on =

Gitorious.org:
http://meego.gitorious.org/meego-cellular/matd

Best regards and happy new year,

